# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
Consolidated source export for the three EMOTIC research notebooks.

This file collects the original notebook cell source in phase order.
Notebook outputs are intentionally excluded. The original .ipynb files are
the authoritative records and remain unchanged in the repository.

Execution note:
- The source was authored for a GPU notebook environment and includes
  environment-specific paths, caches, pretrained assets, and costly training.
- This flat export uses one Python process/namespace; separate notebooks may
  have relied on kernel isolation. Inspect the phase sections before running
  the whole file end-to-end. Prefer the original notebooks for faithful runs.
- No dependency versions or experiment outputs have been inferred or pinned.

Original notebook files:
- emotic-phasea-v7-without-aug.ipynb
- emotic-phaseb-augmentation.ipynb
- emotic-phasec-geq.ipynb
"""


